<title>EGYPT: Egypt's CIB results at end-Q1 97. [corrected 12:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Egypt's CIB results at end-Q1 97. [corrected 12:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first quarter of calendar 1997, the bank's financial year which started on July 1. (corrects time period)</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available):</p>
<p>Net deposits		7,892,864</p>
<p>Reserves			580,405</p>
<p>Shareholders rights     1,148,070</p>
<p>Profits			  67,665</p>
<p>Distributable profits	67,666</p>
<p>(Full company name is Commercial International Bank (CIB)).</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
